OL,3,ABrazil election goes to run-off as
OL,4,Aright-wing Flavio Bolsonaro wins first
OL,5,Around
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe right-wing Flavio Bolsonaro has won
OL,8,Fthe first round of Brazil's
OL,9,Fpresidential election, beating the
OL,10,Fincumbent left-wing President Lula da
OL,11,FSilva. But he did not obtain more than
OL,12,F50% of the votes required to win
OL,13,Foutright.
OL,15,FThere will be a run-off vote between
OL,16,Fthese two candidates on 25 October.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
